        "notes": "The CMVP page for #4943 (checked 11 November 2026, last updated 10 November 2026) lists software version 2.1.1 and a sunset date of 16 January 2030. #4743 (FIPS 140-3, sunset 28 July 2029) covers 2.0.x. Keycloak's guide names bc-fips 2.1.2, which is not on the certificate: VERIFY which version an operator should install."
